  "sentenceCues": [
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-f5dcf1d5a6dfdb2e-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-f5dcf1d5a6dfdb2e"
      ],
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.92,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 46,
      "text": "Chapter 3: Tactical urbanism and street design"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2"
      ],
      "start": 3.92,
      "end": 9.36,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 77,
      "text": "Tactical urbanism means low-cost, surface-level interventions in urban space."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2"
      ],
      "start": 9.76,
      "end": 18.72,
      "startOffset": 78,
      "endOffset": 223,
      "text": "They are usually temporary, but can become permanent, making alternatives visible and accelerating political action towards a permanent redesign."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2-s3",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-986baa5d3b99b4c2"
      ],
      "start": 18.96,
      "end": 25.6,
      "startOffset": 224,
      "endOffset": 324,
      "text": "They can start conversations, help communities test ideas, and build support for longer-term change."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-2dd6f77cf52d35f2-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-2dd6f77cf52d35f2"
      ],
      "start": 25.6,
      "end": 27.200000000000003,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 16,
      "text": "Basic principles"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-283e8c68128ba1fd-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-283e8c68128ba1fd"
      ],
      "start": 27.200000000000003,
      "end": 32.24,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 77,
      "text": "Tactical urbanism works particularly well when five conditions come together:"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-360eba98aaa1c725-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-360eba98aaa1c725"
      ],
      "start": 32.24,
      "end": 36.480000000000004,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 60,
      "text": "The measure is rooted locally and solves a specific problem."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-9ddbdccea9de7557-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-9ddbdccea9de7557"
      ],
      "start": 36.480000000000004,
      "end": 40.080000000000005,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 54,
      "text": "It can be implemented quickly and carries little risk."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-b1e8bce4d363509a-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-b1e8bce4d363509a"
      ],
      "start": 40.080000000000005,
      "end": 44.080000000000005,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 54,
      "text": "It demonstrates a longer-term change on a small scale."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-d2f972504557b30b-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-d2f972504557b30b"
      ],
      "start": 44.080000000000005,
      "end": 50.480000000000004,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 102,
      "text": "It builds relationships between the neighbourhood, initiatives, public administration and politicians."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-af057bd98361754f-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-af057bd98361754f"
      ],
      "start": 50.480000000000004,
      "end": 57.040000000000006,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 89,
      "text": "It generates useful experience: what works, what needs adjusting, and who uses the space?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-4a62024f01ed982b-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-4a62024f01ed982b"
      ],
      "start": 57.040000000000006,
      "end": 59.28000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 25,
      "text": "Check before every action"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-d490bf9a8eb48de2-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-d490bf9a8eb48de2"
      ],
      "start": 59.28000000000001,
      "end": 66.48,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 111,
      "text": "Can a passer-by recognise within a minute which problem the action highlights and which better use it proposes?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-a3241972350fc033-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-a3241972350fc033"
      ],
      "start": 66.48,
      "end": 67.44,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 5,
      "text": "Tools"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-7db742b2fba381b9-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-7db742b2fba381b9"
      ],
      "start": 67.44,
      "end": 71.67999999999999,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 63,
      "text": "Tactical urbanism tools change the street at the surface level."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-7db742b2fba381b9-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-7db742b2fba381b9"
      ],
      "start": 71.75999999999999,
      "end": 72.64,
      "startOffset": 64,
      "endOffset": 77,
      "text": "They include:"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-c0760cfa8abeeed6-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-c0760cfa8abeeed6"
      ],
      "start": 72.64,
      "end": 77.2,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 62,
      "text": "Barriers such as bollards, concrete elements, or planter rings"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-50ae4bbf424ccc56-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-50ae4bbf424ccc56"
      ],
      "start": 77.2,
      "end": 79.60000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 30,
      "text": "Greenery and planting elements"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-f25c0f5977a98fe5-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-f25c0f5977a98fe5"
      ],
      "start": 79.60000000000001,
      "end": 81.12,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 16,
      "text": "Street furniture"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-5912b6ca06176b7a-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-5912b6ca06176b7a"
      ],
      "start": 81.12,
      "end": 83.44,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 27,
      "text": "Surface design using colour"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-fed031e6b2097c3a-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-fed031e6b2097c3a"
      ],
      "start": 83.44,
      "end": 84.56,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 5,
      "text": "Signs"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-5dca27569318b67c-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-5dca27569318b67c"
      ],
      "start": 84.56,
      "end": 85.60000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 6,
      "text": "Events"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-d3ffe748b8c05814-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-d3ffe748b8c05814"
      ],
      "start": 85.60000000000001,
      "end": 99.44000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 200,
      "text": "Quality lies in the appropriate use of an object, rather than the object itself: a painted surface is only effective if it changes behaviour, helps people find their way, or makes a new use plausible."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-8430484d895cbf2d-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-8430484d895cbf2d"
      ],
      "start": 99.44000000000001,
      "end": 104.16000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 60,
      "text": "Tactical urbanism in practice: examples from Graz and Vienna"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-f2dec508e20e9c9a-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-f2dec508e20e9c9a"
      ],
      "start": 104.16000000000001,
      "end": 106.00000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 19,
      "text": "A practical process"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-52492fcbacf6952d-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-52492fcbacf6952d"
      ],
      "start": 106.00000000000001,
      "end": 106.48000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 2,
      "text": "1."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-52492fcbacf6952d-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-52492fcbacf6952d"
      ],
      "start": 106.96000000000001,
      "end": 109.20000000000002,
      "startOffset": 3,
      "endOffset": 34,
      "text": "Start with people’s experiences"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-5fad34ce3d479fd3-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-5fad34ce3d479fd3"
      ],
      "start": 109.20000000000002,
      "end": 113.48000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 56,
      "text": "Ask what makes a street feel welcoming, safe, or useful."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-5fad34ce3d479fd3-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-5fad34ce3d479fd3"
      ],
      "start": 113.76000000000002,
      "end": 121.92000000000002,
      "startOffset": 57,
      "endOffset": 197,
      "text": "Personal memories – such as the streets people played in as children – can open up a conversation about what public space could offer today."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-d93b32a7cebda355-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-d93b32a7cebda355"
      ],
      "start": 121.92000000000002,
      "end": 122.56000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 2,
      "text": "2."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-d93b32a7cebda355-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-d93b32a7cebda355"
      ],
      "start": 122.80000000000001,
      "end": 126.32000000000002,
      "startOffset": 3,
      "endOffset": 50,
      "text": "Identify who uses the street and what they need"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-26715e94a94f8cd5-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-26715e94a94f8cd5"
      ],
      "start": 126.32000000000002,
      "end": 136.76000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 138,
      "text": "Consider children, older people, wheelchair users, cyclists, pedestrians, local businesses, delivery services, and people who live nearby."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-26715e94a94f8cd5-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-26715e94a94f8cd5"
      ],
      "start": 137.04000000000002,
      "end": 143.60000000000002,
      "startOffset": 139,
      "endOffset": 244,
      "text": "Trees and other elements of the urban environment also have specific needs, such as enough space to grow."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-060d826e49f0ad6d-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-060d826e49f0ad6d"
      ],
      "start": 143.60000000000002,
      "end": 144.48000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 2,
      "text": "3."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-060d826e49f0ad6d-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-060d826e49f0ad6d"
      ],
      "start": 144.56000000000003,
      "end": 147.12000000000003,
      "startOffset": 3,
      "endOffset": 41,
      "text": "Observe and assess the street together"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-80afcd949729f2f5-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-80afcd949729f2f5"
      ],
      "start": 147.12000000000003,
      "end": 153.12000000000003,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 91,
      "text": "A simple street audit can help people discuss questions such as: Is there somewhere to sit?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-80afcd949729f2f5-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-80afcd949729f2f5"
      ],
      "start": 153.20000000000005,
      "end": 154.40000000000003,
      "startOffset": 92,
      "endOffset": 104,
      "text": "Is it noisy?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-80afcd949729f2f5-s3",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-80afcd949729f2f5"
      ],
      "start": 154.52000000000004,
      "end": 156.48000000000002,
      "startOffset": 105,
      "endOffset": 129,
      "text": "How easy is it to cross?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-80afcd949729f2f5-s4",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-80afcd949729f2f5"
      ],
      "start": 156.56000000000003,
      "end": 160.08000000000004,
      "startOffset": 130,
      "endOffset": 188,
      "text": "How is space divided between different forms of transport?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-80afcd949729f2f5-s5",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-80afcd949729f2f5"
      ],
      "start": 160.16000000000003,
      "end": 168.48000000000002,
      "startOffset": 189,
      "endOffset": 322,
      "text": "The Leiwande Straßen Radar, presented by Wir machen Wien, is one example of a tool for assessing a street across multiple categories."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-394727b2b08d5546-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-394727b2b08d5546"
      ],
      "start": 168.48000000000002,
      "end": 169.04000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 2,
      "text": "4."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-394727b2b08d5546-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-394727b2b08d5546"
      ],
      "start": 169.52,
      "end": 171.76000000000002,
      "startOffset": 3,
      "endOffset": 32,
      "text": "Make a shared vision tangible"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-db7d05b19263a5e3-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-db7d05b19263a5e3"
      ],
      "start": 171.76000000000002,
      "end": 178.88000000000002,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 112,
      "text": "A scale model or design table lets participants rearrange a street and explore different possibilities together."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-db7d05b19263a5e3-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-db7d05b19263a5e3"
      ],
      "start": 179.36,
      "end": 188.16000000000003,
      "startOffset": 113,
      "endOffset": 241,
      "text": "Temporary paint, movable seating, planters, or full-size banners can show how a different street layout might feel in real life."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-624c0fb6690d27d7-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-624c0fb6690d27d7"
      ],
      "start": 188.16000000000003,
      "end": 188.8,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 2,
      "text": "5."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-624c0fb6690d27d7-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-624c0fb6690d27d7"
      ],
      "start": 189.20000000000002,
      "end": 191.76000000000002,
      "startOffset": 3,
      "endOffset": 30,
      "text": "Test, listen, and follow up"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-54639e613c6885e0-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-54639e613c6885e0"
      ],
      "start": 191.76000000000002,
      "end": 196.64000000000001,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 79,
      "text": "Use a temporary intervention to gather reactions from residents and passers-by."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-54639e613c6885e0-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-54639e613c6885e0"
      ],
      "start": 197.12000000000003,
      "end": 205.20000000000002,
      "startOffset": 80,
      "endOffset": 223,
      "text": "Share what you learned, explain how feedback will influence the next steps, and connect the experiment to discussions with the local authority."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-cd9dab14357036dd-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-cd9dab14357036dd"
      ],
      "start": 205.20000000000002,
      "end": 208.00000000000003,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 42,
      "text": "What can a temporary intervention achieve?"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9"
      ],
      "start": 208.00000000000003,
      "end": 218.40000000000003,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 143,
      "text": "Prostorož’s examples from Ljubljana show how simple materials and temporary changes can create new places to sit, meet, or spend time outdoors."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9"
      ],
      "start": 218.72000000000003,
      "end": 225.88000000000002,
      "startOffset": 144,
      "endOffset": 242,
      "text": "In one project, a street was reimagined as a small public place using seating, colour, and plants."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9-s3",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-e8ad1435ee3b9cb9"
      ],
      "start": 226.16000000000003,
      "end": 236.88000000000002,
      "startOffset": 243,
      "endOffset": 414,
      "text": "In another, a temporary redesign near schools created a safer route and a place for children to spend time after school while a permanent solution was still being decided."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-0d5686f047f8c8a6-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-0d5686f047f8c8a6"
      ],
      "start": 236.88000000000002,
      "end": 241.28000000000003,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 66,
      "text": "These examples also show that temporary can still be long-lasting."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-0d5686f047f8c8a6-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-0d5686f047f8c8a6"
      ],
      "start": 241.84000000000003,
      "end": 253.12000000000003,
      "startOffset": 67,
      "endOffset": 243,
      "text": "Choose materials to match the purpose: lightweight elements can work well for a brief test, while a pilot that may remain in place for years needs robust, repairable materials."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-ddbf744435b761f4-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-ddbf744435b761f4"
      ],
      "start": 253.12000000000003,
      "end": 254.64000000000004,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 20,
      "text": "What to keep in mind"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0-s1",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0"
      ],
      "start": 254.64000000000004,
      "end": 258.16,
      "startOffset": 0,
      "endOffset": 57,
      "text": "The process matters as much as the physical intervention."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0-s2",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0"
      ],
      "start": 258.64000000000004,
      "end": 266.44000000000005,
      "startOffset": 58,
      "endOffset": 187,
      "text": "If people are only asked for feedback and then hear nothing about how their feedback was used, participation can feel tokenistic."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0-s3",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0"
      ],
      "start": 266.72,
      "end": 273.72,
      "startOffset": 188,
      "endOffset": 297,
      "text": "Be transparent about what can change, involve affected people early, and keep them informed as plans develop."
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0-s4",
      "blockIds": [
        "b-8e5d8d41e018fea0"
      ],
      "start": 274.00000000000006,
      "end": 282.96000000000004,
      "startOffset": 298,
      "endOffset": 446,
      "text": "Tactical urbanism works best when an experiment leads to learning – and when that learning has a clear path towards lasting, inclusive improvements."
    }
  ]
}
